{
  "_about": "The Island's seeds (src/island/seeds.ts). Each game has its family: finishing today's round gives its common seed, a good score may add its rare seed. Two seeds planted together grow what the seeds list (stage 2); two families' seeds crossed make the hybrids. Items are what grows: kind says where it goes (block, floor, wall, decor, furniture, light, music, plant, frame, screen: a TV playing a card’s clip; door, stairs, ladder, platform, bounce, warp, rail, zip: things to move around; craft: a furnace or a workbench (src/island/crafting.ts); chest, spikes, gate: the dungeon’s own (src/island/dungeon.ts), never in a bag; reader: holds a Mythic or Omni card and plays its line; disc: a vinyl or a CD, played in a record or CD player, never placed). The fish-* items are caught fishing (src/island/fishing.ts), not grown. Names in English and French.",
